{
  "body": "<a class=\"skip\" href=\"#main\">skip to content</a>\n<header class=\"site-header\"><a class=\"brand\" href=\"/\" aria-label=\"Kiln home\"><svg class=\"brand-mark\" viewBox=\"-1 -1 103 35\" width=\"103\" height=\"35\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><g class=\"header-spark\"><path d=\"M13.9822 0L23.9694 4.49428L19.4751 14.4815L9.48789 9.98725L13.9822 0Z\" fill=\"currentColor\" /></g><path d=\"M0 15.4803H10.4866V22.4713H19.4751V15.4803H29.9618V32.9579H0V15.4803Z\" fill=\"currentColor\" /><path transform=\"translate(32.409095 32.958) scale(0.033065 -0.033065)\" d=\"M77 740H205V306H211L286 388L413 516H562L357 313L584 0H431L266 240L205 182V0H77Z\" fill=\"currentColor\" /><path transform=\"translate(50.348884999999996 32.958) scale(0.033065 -0.033065)\" d=\"M332 596Q287 596 268.5 615.0Q250 634 250 661V685Q250 712 268.5 731.0Q287 750 332 750Q377 750 395.5 731.0Q414 712 414 685V661Q414 634 395.5 615.0Q377 596 332 596ZM98 101H268V415H98V516H396V101H554V0H98Z\" fill=\"currentColor\" /><path transform=\"translate(67.517515 32.958) scale(0.033065 -0.033065)\" d=\"M72 101H236V639H72V740H364V101H529V0H72Z\" fill=\"currentColor\" /><path transform=\"translate(84.30952500000001 32.958) scale(0.033065 -0.033065)\" d=\"M75 0V516H203V425H208Q225 467 260.5 497.5Q296 528 359 528Q435 528 482.5 477.5Q530 427 530 333V0H402V315Q402 427 305 427Q285 427 267.0 422.0Q249 417 234.5 406.5Q220 396 211.5 381.0Q203 366 203 345V0Z\" fill=\"currentColor\" /></svg></a><nav class=\"site-nav\" aria-label=\"Main\"><a href=\"#local\">KilnOS</a><a href=\"#hardware\">hardware</a><a href=\"/about\">about</a><button class=\"nav-contact enquiry-open\">contact</button></nav><button class=\"header-cta register-open\">register interest <span class=\"square\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></button><button class=\"menu-toggle\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"mobile-menu\" aria-label=\"Open menu\"><span class=\"menu-square\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></button></header>\n<nav class=\"mobile-menu\" id=\"mobile-menu\" aria-label=\"Main menu\" hidden><div class=\"menu-links\"><a href=\"#local\"><span class=\"menu-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>KilnOS<span class=\"menu-number\" aria-hidden=\"true\">01</span></a><a href=\"#hardware\"><span class=\"menu-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>hardware<span class=\"menu-number\" aria-hidden=\"true\">02</span></a><a href=\"/about\"><span class=\"menu-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>about<span class=\"menu-number\" aria-hidden=\"true\">03</span></a><button class=\"menu-contact enquiry-open\"><span class=\"menu-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>contact<span class=\"menu-number\" aria-hidden=\"true\">04</span></button></div><div class=\"menu-bottom\"><button class=\"action primary register-open\">register interest <span class=\"square\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></button><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"/hardware\">explore the hardware <span class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></div></nav>\n<main id=\"main\">\n<div class=\"intro-runway\">\n<section class=\"section hero\" id=\"top\" aria-labelledby=\"hero-title\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n<div class=\"hero-poster\"><h1 class=\"hero-title\" id=\"hero-title\"><span class=\"hero-lead\">Make it</span> <span class=\"hero-box\"><span class=\"hero-word\">here</span></span></h1><figure class=\"hero-device\"><img src=\"/assets/kiln/finishes/charcoal-device-800.webp\" data-render=\"/assets/kiln/finishes/charcoal-device\" width=\"800\" height=\"960\" alt=\"Deep charcoal Kiln One with a matte shell, a brown leather handle and a dark vented metal front\" decoding=\"async\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></figure></div>\n<div class=\"hero-bottom\"><div><p>Private AI for creative studios.<br>Built around the way you make.</p><p class=\"hero-membership\"><a class=\"hero-inception\" href=\"https://www.nvidia.com/en-gb/startups/\"><img src=\"/assets/kiln/nvidia-inception.png\" width=\"1168\" height=\"404\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\"><span>Member of the NVIDIA Inception programme</span></a></p></div><div class=\"action-row\"><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"/hardware\">explore the hardware <span class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></div></div>\n<div class=\"intro-caption\"><button class=\"intro-skip\" aria-label=\"Skip the close-up and explore Kiln\">scroll to explore <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</span></button></div>\n</section>\n</div>\n<section class=\"section local\" id=\"local\" aria-labelledby=\"local-title\">\n<div class=\"section-head\"><span class=\"meta\">01 / meet KilnOS</span><span class=\"meta\">in development</span></div>\n<div class=\"section-intro\"><h2 id=\"local-title\">Own the compute.<br>No cloud credits.</h2><p>Keep your models, project files and creative tools in one workspace, running on hardware you control.</p></div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"section hardware\" id=\"hardware\" data-product=\"one\" aria-labelledby=\"hardware-title\">\n<div class=\"section-head\"><span class=\"meta\">02 / the hardware</span><span class=\"meta\">Kiln One</span></div>\n<div class=\"finish-runway\" id=\"one-finishes\" data-finish-gallery>\n<div class=\"finish-stage\" id=\"one-heading\">\n<h2 class=\"finish-title\" id=\"hardware-title\">Kiln.</h2>\n<figure class=\"finish-viewer\" aria-label=\"Kiln One finish gallery\"><div class=\"finish-window\">\n<div class=\"finish-slide\" data-finish-slide=\"charcoal\" hidden><img src=\"/assets/kiln/finishes/charcoal-device-800.webp\" data-render=\"/assets/kiln/finishes/charcoal-device\" width=\"800\" height=\"960\" alt=\"Kiln One in deep charcoal, with a brown leather handle and a dark vented metal front panel.\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div class=\"finish-slide\" data-finish-slide=\"pebble-grey\" hidden><img src=\"/assets/kiln/finishes/pebble-grey-device-800.webp\" data-render=\"/assets/kiln/finishes/pebble-grey-device\" width=\"800\" height=\"960\" alt=\"Kiln One in pebble grey, with a soft brown leather handle and a vented metal front panel.\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div class=\"finish-slide\" data-finish-slide=\"baby-pink\"><img src=\"/assets/kiln/finishes/baby-pink-device-800.webp\" data-render=\"/assets/kiln/finishes/baby-pink-device\" width=\"800\" height=\"960\" alt=\"Kiln One in baby pink, with a soft brown leather handle and a vented metal front panel.\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div class=\"finish-slide\" data-finish-slide=\"eucalyptus\" hidden><img src=\"/assets/kiln/finishes/eucalyptus-device-800.webp\" data-render=\"/assets/kiln/finishes/eucalyptus-device\" width=\"800\" height=\"960\" alt=\"Kiln One in eucalyptus, with a soft brown leather handle and a vented metal front panel.\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div class=\"finish-slide\" data-finish-slide=\"powder-blue\" hidden><img src=\"/assets/kiln/finishes/powder-blue-device-800.webp\" data-render=\"/assets/kiln/finishes/powder-blue-device\" width=\"800\" height=\"960\" alt=\"Kiln One in powder blue, with a soft brown leather handle and a vented metal front panel.\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<span class=\"finish-lens\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n</div>\n<figcaption class=\"finish-controls\"><div class=\"finish-caption\"><span>Kiln One</span><span data-finish-name>Baby pink</span></div>\n<div class=\"finish-swatches\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Choose a finish\"><a class=\"finish-swatch\" data-finish=\"charcoal\" style=\"--swatch:#3d3b38\" href=\"/assets/kiln/finishes/charcoal-device-6400.webp\" aria-label=\"Deep charcoal\" title=\"Deep charcoal\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></a><a class=\"finish-swatch\" data-finish=\"pebble-grey\" style=\"--swatch:#a79e91\" href=\"/assets/kiln/finishes/pebble-grey-device-6400.webp\" aria-label=\"Pebble grey\" title=\"Pebble grey\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></a><a class=\"finish-swatch\" data-finish=\"baby-pink\" style=\"--swatch:#e5b4bd\" href=\"/assets/kiln/finishes/baby-pink-device-6400.webp\" aria-label=\"Baby pink\" title=\"Baby pink\" aria-current=\"true\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></a><a class=\"finish-swatch\" data-finish=\"eucalyptus\" style=\"--swatch:#a6ba9e\" href=\"/assets/kiln/finishes/eucalyptus-device-6400.webp\" aria-label=\"Eucalyptus\" title=\"Eucalyptus\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></a><a class=\"finish-swatch\" data-finish=\"powder-blue\" style=\"--swatch:#a7c2d5\" href=\"/assets/kiln/finishes/powder-blue-device-6400.webp\" aria-label=\"Powder blue\" title=\"Powder blue\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></a></div>\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"finish-zoom\" aria-label=\"Show 4× magnifier\" aria-pressed=\"false\" hidden>4×</button></figcaption></figure>\n<div class=\"finish-intro\"><p>Your studio.<br>Your compute.</p></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"product-slide one-overview\"><div class=\"product-bottom\" id=\"one-configurations\"><div><p class=\"product-price\">From £19,900</p><span class=\"product-price-note\">1 GPU / ex VAT</span></div><p class=\"product-description\">A compact workstation with one or two GPUs for local AI creation.</p><div class=\"product-actions\"><button class=\"action primary register-open\" data-interest=\"Kiln One\">register interest <span class=\"square\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></button><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"/products/one\">explore Kiln One <span class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a><button class=\"text-link compare-open\">compare configurations <span class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></button></div></div></div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"section studio-service\" id=\"studio-service\" aria-labelledby=\"service-title\">\n<div class=\"section-head\"><span class=\"meta\">03 / ownership and support</span><span class=\"meta\">proposed offering</span></div>\n<div class=\"section-intro\"><h2 id=\"service-title\">Own the hardware.<br>Choose the support.</h2></div>\n<div class=\"service-grid\"><article><span class=\"meta\">one-time purchase</span><h3>Compute<br>you own.</h3><p>A workstation configured for your models and workload.</p></article><article><span class=\"meta\">optional managed KilnOS</span><h3>Support<br>as you grow.</h3><p>Workflow setup, qualified model updates and standard support.</p></article></div>\n<p class=\"service-boundary\">KilnOS and managed services are in development. Pilot agreements will define scope and measures of success.</p>\n</section>\n<section class=\"section local software-pricing\" id=\"software-pricing\" aria-labelledby=\"software-pricing-title\"><div class=\"section-head\"><span class=\"meta\">managed KilnOS</span><span class=\"meta\">proposed plan / billed annually / ex VAT</span></div><div class=\"section-intro\"><h2 id=\"software-pricing-title\">Priced for<br>your creators.</h2><p>Shared projects, approvals, qualified updates and standard support.</p></div><div class=\"local-grid\"><article><span class=\"meta\">Kiln One</span><h3>£99<br>per creator / month</h3><p>10-creator minimum.<br><strong>£11,880 per year minimum.</strong></p><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"/products/one#software-pricing\">explore the plan <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></article></div><p class=\"service-boundary\">Review-only seats are free. Creation and agent actions require a paid creator seat. Hardware, cloud usage, custom integrations and enhanced service levels are additional. Licensed seat counts do not guarantee simultaneous workload capacity.</p></section>\n<figure class=\"studio-photo finish-editorial\" id=\"studio\"><img src=\"/assets/kiln/finishes/eucalyptus-960.webp\" srcset=\"/assets/kiln/finishes/eucalyptus-960.webp 960w, /assets/kiln/finishes/eucalyptus-3840.webp 3840w\" sizes=\"100vw\" width=\"3840\" height=\"2880\" alt=\"Eucalyptus Kiln One, with a stone-textured shell and a soft brown leather handle\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></figure>\n<section class=\"section privacy\" id=\"privacy\" aria-labelledby=\"privacy-title\">\n<div class=\"section-head\"><span class=\"meta\">04 / data control</span><span class=\"meta\">local by design.</span></div>\n<h2 class=\"privacy-title\" id=\"privacy-title\"><span class=\"privacy-first\">What stays</span> <span class=\"privacy-inside\">inside.</span> <span class=\"privacy-tail\">You set the boundary.</span></h2>\n<div class=\"privacy-grid\"><article><h3>Local work.</h3><p>Models, source files and drafts are designed to stay on Kiln and authorised team devices.</p></article><article><h3>External tools.</h3><p>Cloud tools require project approval. Sign-in and updates may still need internet access.</p></article><article><h3>Team access.</h3><p>Set project permissions and review work before it leaves the studio.</p></article></div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"section network-thesis\" id=\"network\" data-network-thesis data-network-state=\"reserve\" aria-labelledby=\"network-title\">\n<div class=\"section-head\"><span class=\"meta\">05 / the network thesis</span><span class=\"meta\">future direction / opt-in</span></div>\n<div class=\"section-intro\"><h2 id=\"network-title\">Studio first.<br>Network next.</h2><div><p>Our longer-term ambition is an optional network where studios offer spare compute and creators access KilnOS without buying hardware.</p></div></div>\n<div class=\"network-model\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Explore the proposed capacity-sharing model\">\n<div class=\"network-model-head\"><p class=\"network-state\"><span class=\"square\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span data-network-status aria-live=\"polite\">Set aside what your studio needs.</span></p><span class=\"meta\">illustrative capacity</span></div>\n<div class=\"network-controls\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Choose a capacity scenario\"><button type=\"button\" data-network-step=\"reserve\" aria-pressed=\"true\">01 reserve</button><button type=\"button\" data-network-step=\"share\" aria-pressed=\"false\">02 share</button><button type=\"button\" data-network-step=\"reclaim\" aria-pressed=\"false\">03 reclaim</button></div><div class=\"network-capacity\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>\n<div class=\"network-legend\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span><i></i>your studio</span><span class=\"network-available\"><i></i><span data-network-label>available capacity</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"network-steps\">\n<article class=\"network-step\" data-network-copy=\"reserve\"><span class=\"meta\">01 / reserve</span><strong>Keep what you need.</strong><span class=\"network-step-copy\">Set when your Kiln is available and how much capacity you choose to share.</span></article>\n<article class=\"network-step\" data-network-copy=\"share\"><span class=\"meta\">02 / share</span><strong>Put spare hours to work.</strong><span class=\"network-step-copy\">Eligible paid jobs could run on participating machines, earning income for their owners.</span></article>\n<article class=\"network-step\" data-network-copy=\"reclaim\"><span class=\"meta\">03 / reclaim</span><strong>Your studio comes first.</strong><span class=\"network-step-copy\">The goal is to pause or move network jobs when your own work needs the capacity.</span></article>\n</div></div>\n<p class=\"network-note\"><strong>Still to validate.</strong> Workload isolation, studio priority, reclaim time and the economics.</p>\n</section>\n<figure class=\"hardware-interlude finish-interlude\" aria-labelledby=\"hardware-interlude-caption\"><img src=\"/assets/kiln/finishes/powder-blue-960.webp\" srcset=\"/assets/kiln/finishes/powder-blue-960.webp 960w, /assets/kiln/finishes/powder-blue-3840.webp 3840w\" sizes=\"100vw\" width=\"3840\" height=\"2880\" alt=\"Detail of the powder blue Kiln One\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption id=\"hardware-interlude-caption\"><p>A place for<br>your ideas.</p></figcaption></figure>\n<section class=\"section co-founders\" id=\"team\" aria-labelledby=\"team-title\">\n<div class=\"section-head\"><span class=\"meta\">06 / team</span></div>\n<div class=\"founders-layout\"><h2 id=\"team-title\">Co-founders.</h2><!-- founder portraits --></div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"section faq\" id=\"questions\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-title\">\n<div class=\"section-head\"><span class=\"meta\">07 / a closer look</span></div>\n<div class=\"faq-layout\"><div><h2 id=\"faq-title\">Clear on<br>the details.</h2></div><div>\n<details><summary>Why choose Kiln over a GPU workstation?</summary><p>Kiln’s proposed value is the complete studio setup: local compute, a shared creative workspace and optional managed support. Pilots will test whether it improves the quality of the work and saves time in production.</p></details>\n<details><summary>Does every task stay local?</summary><p>Local workflows are designed to keep models, prompts, source files and generated drafts on Kiln and authorised team devices. Optional external tools require project approval. Company sign-in and software updates may still need internet access.</p></details>\n<details><summary>Can we use our own models?</summary><p>That is the plan, subject to licensing, compatibility and available memory. We’re qualifying the first collection for creative directions, image storyboards and revision.</p></details>\n<details><summary>What does £19,900 include?</summary><p>Our proposed Kiln One hardware price includes one NVIDIA RTX PRO 6000 Blackwell 96 GB GPU, 128 GB system memory and 4 TB storage. Choose two GPUs for £31,900. Prices exclude VAT; managed KilnOS, optional cloud use and separately scoped services are additional. Final specifications and quotes will be confirmed before ordering.</p></details><details><summary>What does a GPU upgrade add?</summary><p>One goes from one to two GPUs. Extra GPUs give compatible workflows more capacity for parallel jobs and larger models. They do not automatically double speed or the number of active users. One’s second GPU adds £12,000 when ordering. Later upgrades are quoted individually.</p></details>\n<details><summary>Who needs a paid seat?</summary><p>Creation and agent actions require a paid creator seat. Review-only seats are free. Plans have a creator minimum and are billed annually. <a href=\"#software-pricing\">explore the proposed plan.</a></p></details><details><summary>Does a GPU upgrade change our subscription?</summary><p>No. Your product’s per-creator rate stays the same. The subscription follows your paid seat count, subject to the plan minimum; extra GPUs add workload capacity.</p></details>\n<details><summary>When can I order Kiln?</summary><p>Register interest for product news and launch details. Orders are not open yet, and no payment or commitment is required.</p></details><details><summary>How do we discuss a pilot or investment?</summary><p>Use Contact to tell us about your studio or investment interest. Pilots are arranged through direct conversations; joining the update list does not apply for a pilot.</p></details>\n</div></div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"section pilot\" id=\"interest\" aria-labelledby=\"interest-title\"><div class=\"section-head\"><span class=\"meta\">08 / stay close to Kiln</span></div><h2 class=\"pilot-title\" id=\"interest-title\">Be first<span>to know.</span></h2><div class=\"pilot-bottom\"><p class=\"lead\">Product progress and launch news.<br>Straight to your inbox.</p><div><button class=\"action primary register-open\">register interest <span class=\"square\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></button><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"/hardware\">explore the hardware <span class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a><p class=\"fine\">No payment or commitment. <a href=\"/privacy\">privacy details</a></p></div></div></section>\n</main>\n<footer class=\"site-footer\"><div class=\"footer-main\"><a href=\"#top\" aria-label=\"Kiln home\"><img src=\"/assets/kiln-lockup-semibold-paper.svg\" width=\"135\" height=\"46\" alt=\"kiln\"></a><p>Independent thinking.<br>Local compute.</p><nav aria-label=\"Footer\"><a href=\"/about\">about Kiln</a><a href=\"#hardware\">the hardware</a><a href=\"#network\">our network thesis</a><a href=\"#questions\">questions</a><a href=\"#privacy\">our privacy direction</a><a href=\"/privacy\">website privacy</a><button class=\"footer-contact enquiry-open\">contact us ↗</button></nav></div><div class=\"footer-bottom\"><span>© Kiln 2026 / Porto Labs</span><span>Hardware and software in development.</span><a href=\"#top\">back to top ↑</a></div></footer>\n<button class=\"mobile-dock register-open\">register interest <span class=\"square\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></button>\n<dialog id=\"register-dialog\" aria-labelledby=\"register-title\"><button class=\"dialog-close\" aria-label=\"Close registration\">×</button><h2 id=\"register-title\">Keep in<br>touch.</h2><p>Product news and launch updates.</p><form action=\"https://formspree.io/f/xjgepgbg\" method=\"POST\" class=\"enquiry-form\" data-enquiry-kind=\"interest\"><div class=\"field\"><label for=\"register-email\">email</label><input id=\"register-email\" name=\"email\" type=\"email\" maxlength=\"254\" autocomplete=\"email\" placeholder=\"you@studio.com\" required></div><div class=\"field\"><label for=\"register-product\">interested in <span>(optional)</span></label><select id=\"register-product\" name=\"product\"><option>Still exploring</option><option>Kiln One</option><option>Media</option><option>Legal</option><option>Investor interest</option></select></div><label class=\"consent\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"consent\" required><span>Email me Kiln updates.</span></label><div class=\"form-trap\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><label>leave this empty<input name=\"website\" type=\"text\" tabindex=\"-1\" autocomplete=\"off\"></label></div><p class=\"form-note\">Unsubscribe anytime. <a href=\"/privacy\">privacy</a></p><p class=\"form-error\" role=\"alert\" hidden></p><button class=\"action primary\" type=\"submit\">keep me posted <span class=\"square\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></button></form><div class=\"form-status\" role=\"status\" hidden><h3>You’re on the list.</h3><p>Thanks for following along.</p><button class=\"text-link dialog-done\">back to Kiln <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></button></div></dialog>\n<dialog id=\"enquiry-dialog\" aria-labelledby=\"enquiry-title\" aria-describedby=\"contact-intro\"><button class=\"dialog-close\" aria-label=\"Close contact\">×</button><h2 id=\"enquiry-title\" tabindex=\"-1\">Let’s talk.</h2><p class=\"contact-intro\" id=\"contact-intro\">What are you working on?</p><form class=\"enquiry-form\" data-enquiry-kind=\"contact\"><input id=\"enquiry-interest\" type=\"hidden\" name=\"reason\" value=\"General question\"><div class=\"field\"><label for=\"work-email\">your email</label><input id=\"work-email\" name=\"email\" type=\"email\" maxlength=\"254\" autocomplete=\"email\" placeholder=\"you@studio.com\" required></div><div class=\"field\"><label for=\"workflow-message\">your message</label><textarea id=\"workflow-message\" name=\"message\" rows=\"3\" maxlength=\"3000\" placeholder=\"A project, a question, an idea…\" required></textarea></div><div class=\"form-trap\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><label>leave this empty<input name=\"website\" type=\"text\" tabindex=\"-1\" autocomplete=\"off\"></label></div><p class=\"form-error\" role=\"alert\" hidden></p><button class=\"action primary contact-send\" type=\"submit\"><span data-submit-label>send message</span><span class=\"square\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></button><p class=\"form-note\">Just a reply. No mailing list. <a href=\"/privacy\">privacy</a></p></form><div class=\"form-status\" role=\"status\" hidden><h3>Message received.</h3><p>The Kiln team will follow up by email.</p><button class=\"text-link dialog-done\">back to Kiln <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></button></div><div class=\"contact-booking\"><span>Prefer a conversation?</span><a href=\"/book/\">book a call <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></div></dialog>\n<dialog id=\"compare-dialog\" class=\"compare-dialog\" aria-labelledby=\"compare-title\"><button class=\"dialog-close\" aria-label=\"Close comparison\">×</button><span class=\"meta\">hardware / compare</span><h2 id=\"compare-title\">Find your fit.</h2><p>Proposed configurations. In development.</p><div class=\"compare-grid\"><article class=\"compare-item\"><h3>Kiln One</h3><strong>From £19,900</strong><p class=\"fine\">1 GPU / ex VAT</p><dl><dt>Graphics</dt><dd>RTX PRO 6000 / 96 GB per GPU</dd><dt>GPU capacity</dt><dd>1 GPU, expandable up to 2</dd><dt>Two-GPU configuration</dt><dd>£31,900 ex VAT</dd><dt>Upgrade when ordering</dt><dd>+£12,000 for a second GPU</dd><dt>System memory / Storage</dt><dd>128 GB / 4 TB</dd><dt>Dimensions / W × H × D</dt><dd>250 × 450 × 460 mm</dd></dl></article></div><p class=\"fine\">All figures are engineering targets, subject to validation. GPU memory is per card; multiple cards do not automatically form one memory pool. Renders show hardware concepts.</p><button class=\"text-link dialog-done\">back to the hardware <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></button></dialog>\n",
